# Generated TLC artifacts — never source authority, never committed.
#
# All TLC state, trace, checkpoint, coverage, dump, and temporary files
# produced by model checking must land under .work/. The runner
# (scripts/formal/run-recovery-tlc.mjs) points TLC's -metadir here.
.work/

# Defensive catch-alls for TLC-generated artifacts that might escape .work/
# if a model is invoked manually without the runner.
*.out
*.st
*.dot
*.graph
states/
states-*/

# Editor / Toolbox noise. The graphical TLA+ Toolbox may create this if
# someone opens the model locally; it is not part of the reproducible
# command-line verification path.
.toolbox/
metadir/

# Never ignore source files (defensive — these are the formal model itself).
!*.tla
!*.cfg
!*.md
